{"asset_key":"ep1/env_story_11302480","episode":"ep1","category":"env_story","story_id":"11302480","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:1:1130248001:1":{"text":"나는 호각 소리가 들리면 그 소리를 따라서 북을 칠 거야.","source_cn":"我在等号角吹响，然后跟随号角声，我会开始敲击战鼓。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9CC7462194870723","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1130248002:1":{"text":"북소리가 울려 퍼지면 아센 사막 전사들의 심장도 따라 뛰겠지.","source_cn":"当战鼓响起时，荒角沙漠勇士们的心脏也会随之跳动。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7F831FC6449A2376","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1130248003:1":{"text":"북소리가 멈출 때까지 전투는 끝나지 않아.","source_cn":"战鼓不停，战斗不止。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x633916D46421B7A6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:蛮血克里比特":{"text":"크리비크","source":"蛮血克里比特","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":4,"localized_text_count":3,"speaker_count":1}}